	<Item Name="GDS" Type="String" />
	<Item Name="title" Type="String">Genome-wide screens reveal that resveratrol induces replicative stress in human cells</Item>
	<Item Name="summary" Type="String">Using genome-wide CRISPR-Cas9 screens and other cell-based assays, we show that the pro-longevity agent resveratrol and its analogue pterostilbene induce a genetic signature of replicative stress that is similar to hydroxyurea</Item>
